<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIA SCORE 267-6 OFF 50 OVERS V SOUTH AFRICA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA SCORE 267-6 OFF 50 OVERS V SOUTH AFRICA.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>India scored 267 for six wickets</p>
<p>off their allotted 50 overs in the one-off one-day international</p>
<p>againast South Africa on Saturday.</p>
</text>
